## Tests

There are **no** existing unit tests under `test/ut/spec` for bar labels (`test/ut/spec/series` contains only `custom.test.ts` and `aria-columns-exclude.test.ts`). Relevant manual/visual pages: `test/bar-label-rotation.html` (+ visual-regression action `test/runTest/actions/bar-label-rotation.json`), `test/bar-polar-label.html`, `test/label-position.html`, `test/bar-polar-clockwise.html` (covers the `clockwise: false` angle case), `test/bar-stack-reverse.html`. None of them currently contain a `0` datum with `label.position: 'outside'`, so add one (e.g. `data: [0, 5, 10]`, `label: {show: true, position: 'outside'}`, plus a variant with `yAxis.inverse: true` and a horizontal-bar variant with `xAxis.inverse: true`) to reproduce. A new `test/ut/spec/chart/bar.test.ts` could assert `el.textConfig.position` after `chart.setOption`, reading the bar element via `chart.getModel().getSeries()[0].getData().getItemGraphicEl(i)`.
